        <div class="lesson-card">
            
            <div class="lesson-text">
                <h1>How to Fold a Crab</h1>
                <p>Learn how to fold a cute origami crab with its distinct claws. Start with a square piece of paper.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Fold the paper in half top to bottom.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Fold in half again from left to right.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Open the top pocket and flatten it down to form a triangle.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 4:</strong> Turn the paper over.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 5:</strong> Open the pocket on this side and flatten it to complete the triangle base (Waterbomb base).</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 6:</strong> Fold the top flaps downward at an angle to form the crab's claws.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 7:</strong> Turn the model over.</li>
                    <li><strong>Step 8:</strong> Fold the bottom edge up slightly to form the crab's flat body.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

